#: ../../tools/ncbi_variation_tools.rst:94 ef3a36c4933a4ad1827efea96cdd6266
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get the canonical (normalized) SPDI representation for a"
" variant. Returns the single canonical form of a variant after "
"normalization (right-shifting for indels, using the top-level chromosome "
"sequence). Useful for variant deduplication and consistent storage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ncbi_variation_tools.rst:98 ea36b7a0062c48629af897d90fe4c3d1
msgid ""
"``spdi`` (string) (required) Variant in SPDI notation to normalize. "
"Examples: 'NC\\_000001.11:230710047:A:G', 'NM\\_000546.6:214:C:G' (TP53)"
msgstr ""

